# Ordinary standard OTel only. Generate fresh bytes with fixtures standard-generate.
# Export SENTRAME_URL/PASSPHRASE/SERVER_TOKEN for the verifier; REST Client also
# needs baseUrl,serverToken,standardTrace in its private rest/.env.

### Trace detail is protected even with a known native trace ID
# @no-cookie-jar
# @expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{standardTrace}}

### Owner login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}

< ./generated/standard-login.json

### Ordinary native spans, no journey fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-traces.bin

### Exact and trace-only logs; anonymous logs are sent once
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-logs.bin

### Protected trace discovery
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces

### Native structure/timing and typed contextual reads
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{standardTrace}}

### Exact native replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-traces.bin

### Same span projection through standard JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-traces.json

### Same native spans through gzip
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Content-Encoding: gzip
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-traces.bin.gz

### Replay preserves native identity, structure and inclusive timing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{standardTrace}}

### Preview ordinary-name mappings (no stage.name)
# For manual REST Client use, copy csrf from login into private rest/.env.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/preview
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

< ./fixtures/standard-mapping.json

### Activate prospective owner definition
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/definitions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

< ./fixtures/standard-mapping.json

### Explicit non-persisting preview of retained trace under new meaning
# For manual REST Client use, standardDefinition is the returned version.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{standardTrace}}?previewDefinition={{standardDefinition}}

### Default still uses receipt-time definitions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{standardTrace}}

### Enriched future capture: owner Vote saved overrides emitted voting
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-enriched.bin

### Unmapped retry has a suggestion; owner commitment remains literal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{enrichedTrace}}

### Conflicting generic rule is rejected without activation
# @expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/definitions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

< ./fixtures/standard-conflict.json

### Save the captured definition context, without retaining raw evidence
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/views
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Standard voting capture","mode":"overview","definition":{{standardDefinition}},"startOccurrence":"first","endOccurrence":"last"}

### Owner explicitly accepts voting.retry as a literal supporting-activity mapping
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/definitions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

< ./fixtures/standard-accepted-hint.json

### New tag values cannot rename earlier captured meaning
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{enrichedTrace}}

### Replay enriched native bytes after definition activation
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-enriched.bin

### Replay keeps native structure and timing unchanged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{enrichedTrace}}

### Future capture emits changed.retry while owner literal stays voting.retry
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-future.bin

### Accepted literal mapping applies prospectively
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{futureTrace}}

### Reference still pins its original definition
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/views

### Activate scoped voting definition
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/definitions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

< ./fixtures/standard-journey-mapping.json

### Explicit browser scope/tab: navigation, intent, optional synthetic presence and page pair
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{browserToken}}

< ./generated/standard-journey-browser.bin

### Separate failed and retry request traces under the same explicit scope/tab
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/traces
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-journey-traces.bin

### Trusted failure, post-commit publication error and recovery facts
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{serverToken}}

< ./generated/standard-journey-server.bin

### Persistence and HTTP success do not invent the separately configured screen goal
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot?scope={{journeyScope}}

### Save a trace-mode reference distinct from chronological journey references
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/views
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Native voting request","mode":"trace","trace":"{{journeyTrace}}","definition":{{standardDefinition}},"layout":"tree"}

### Activate another prospective definition while the existing journey is active
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/definitions
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

< ./fixtures/standard-journey-next-mapping.json

### Actual synthetic completion-screen observation arrives under the new receipt version
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{browserToken}}

< ./generated/standard-journey-goal.bin

### Completed scoped voting journey
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot?scope={{journeyScope}}

### Exact goal replay cannot start another journey
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/logs
Content-Type: application/x-protobuf
Authorization: Bearer {{browserToken}}

< ./generated/standard-journey-goal.bin

### Completed scoped voting journey
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/snapshot?scope={{journeyScope}}

### Trace reference pins its explicit mode and original definition
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/traces/{{journeyTrace}}?reference={{traceReference}}
